{"id":"n89257-1-6","stage":4,"title":"흘러들다 · 流进","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89257-1-6-1","ko":"어디서 물이 흘러들고 있는 건가?","zh":"水是从哪里漏进来的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디서","audio":"/audio/2239e13aeeae3639dd35.mp3"}},{"text":"물이","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물이","audio":"/audio/bbb693e9d07d2f260739.mp3"}},{"text":"흘러들고","meaning":"流进，流入","explanation":"흘러들다：流进，流入；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"흘러들다","audio":"/audio/7b5a94679db50ef84651.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89257","senseId":"1","lemma":"흘러들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흘러들고","audio":"/audio/c1db4ef5804ef898650b.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"건가?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건가","audio":"/audio/ee98f3e325b0504ec042.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不确定的或难以准确表述的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"7b5a94679db50ef8","term":"흘러들다","zh":"流进，流入","audio":"/audio/7b5a94679db50ef84651.mp3","entryId":"89257","definition":"水等流进去或流进来。","pronunciation":["흘러들다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/8ab4d48ed85537ac0793.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89257-1-6-2","ko":"배 앞쪽에 구멍이 난 것 같습니다.","zh":"船的前部好像有个洞。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"배","meaning":"船","explanation":"배：船","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29729","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}},{"text":"앞쪽에","meaning":"前面，前头，前部","explanation":"앞쪽：前面，前头，前部；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"앞쪽","audio":"/audio/ec998989eadbec6bfb43.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71505","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞쪽에","audio":"/audio/b83ccc416337368fa8ba.mp3"}},{"text":"구멍이","meaning":"窟窿，洞，孔","explanation":"구멍：窟窿，洞，孔；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"구멍","audio":"/audio/bdf45aec9d9cea46cc2f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34923","senseId":"1","lemma":"구멍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구멍이","audio":"/audio/00f055d11d92593f5f1a.mp3"}},{"text":"난","meaning":"钻，打，划","explanation":"나다：钻，打，划；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"3","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같습니다.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같습니다","audio":"/audio/70b461d79f2fe5361c43.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"船","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"29729","definition":"运载人或东西，在水上行驶的交通工具。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"ec998989eadbec6b","term":"앞쪽","zh":"前面，前头，前部","audio":"/audio/ec998989eadbec6bfb43.mp3","entryId":"71505","definition":"向着前面的方向。","pronunciation":["압쪽"]},{"id":"bdf45aec9d9cea46","term":"구멍","zh":"窟窿，洞，孔","audio":"/audio/bdf45aec9d9cea46cc2f.mp3","entryId":"34923","definition":"穿破或挖出的位置。","pronunciation":["구멍"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"钻，打，划","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现洞或伤口等。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/240a1c473dc355987ede.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.762,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89257","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":134,"sequenceScore":2.5887,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["船的前部好像有个洞。","怎么外面这么吵啊？","水是从哪里漏进来的呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["船的前部好像有个洞。","水是从哪里漏进来的呢？","怎么外面这么吵啊？"],"answer":0}]}
